  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In order to tell if you have muted a group's announcements, you currently have to dig into an individual group's options page.  It is not obvious when scrolling through your group list which groups you have muted and which you do not.\n\nThis is especially relevant because when a group sends an announcement, the \"Mute\" and \"Check\" buttons are immediately next to each other, which may cause people to accidentally click mute. There is no confirmation when muting, and especially inside VR it is easy to accidentally click the wrong button.\n\nAdd a small mute icon onto the group's card when viewing your groups to indicate you have muted their announcements.",
